  "releaseNotes": "The chart panel element names its collections in the interface's language\nUnit properties that refuse no value are marked required\nLocalize public core enum captions with Display resources\nDiagram strategy: a parameter that reshapes its element no longer stops the start\nForget the instruments a diagram strategy found at its start on a reset\nUnwind the blocking waits left by the async rework and fix what it uncovered\nMark the blocking wrappers obsolete\nMove instrument lookups and persistence to async\nLet a formula's assembly go with the block that compiled it\nCorrect diagram runtime behavior",
